    (property "Note" "Schmitt-trigger inputs (74HCS): the key networks' slow edges are within its rating - it has no input transition-rate limit. HC-family outputs, not LVC: the weaker drive. A hop is not a lumped load and need not be - QH to the next SER is data sampled a clock period later, into a Schmitt input (key-register.md). Bit order out is H first, then G F E D C B A" (at 101.6 110.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
